 independents with zero hard violations, while the reputation-only control double-counts mirror/Sybil cases."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_29WZZQ406M19WJS801M1NNPB3S","claim_class":"assumption","created_at":"2026-09-04T07:38:52.459Z","goal_id":"goal_8VBM41JB75VDTSP201M1NNPB3S","id":"rclm_753BHZXNB53CN08201M1NNPB3H","text":"The planning threshold P[theta>0.9]>=0.95 stays a hypothesis without suitable data; reported tails are hypothesis quantities, not truth probabilities."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_29WZZQ406M19WJS801M1NNPB3S","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-04T07:38:52.459Z","goal_id":"goal_8VBM41JB75VDTSP201M1NNPB3S","id":"rclm_8JQT50129S503WVA01M1NNPB3H","text":"PROV defines provenance as information about entities, activities and agents usable to assess quality, reliability and trustworthiness, with derivation and versioning support."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_29WZZQ406M19WJS801M1NNPB3S","claim_class":"assumption","created_at":"2026-09-04T07:38:52.459Z","goal_id":"goal_8VBM41JB75VDTSP201M1NNPB3S","id":"rclm_9V7C8VS2NR8K4B1Z01M1NNPB3H","text":"Lineage equality proxies source dependence for MVP comparison; novel Sybil shapes may evade it."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_29WZZQ406M19WJS801M1NNPB3S","claim_class":"fact","created_at":"2026-09-04T07:38:52.459Z","goal_id":"goal_8VBM41JB75VDTSP201M1NNPB3S","id":"rclm_A0NV26PCM064FCC001M1NNPB3H","text":"S1-003 fixtures expose the lifecycle states that the S1-012 exclusion rules (revoked, superseded, versioned) bind to."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_29WZZQ406M19WJS801M1NNPB3S","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-09-04T07:38:52.459Z","goal_id":"goal_8VBM41JB75VDTSP201M1NNPB3S","id":"rclm_Y0SXR5WWAMZFNDW801M1NNPB3H","text":"Without a logically centralized authority, Sybil attacks remain possible except under extreme resource-parity assumptions, so anchorless mutual-praise clusters must never produce enforcement."},{"campaign_id":"rcamp_29WZZQ406M19WJS801M1NNPB3S","claim_class":"inference","created_at":"2026-09-04T07:38:52.459Z","go